   "/setup/yearend" :Screen Intro="A real, one-time close: zeros every real income and expense account, posting the real, net difference into a real equity account as one, single, balanced entry." "Intro Note"="Real balance-sheet accounts \u2014 Cash, Inventory, Accounts Receivable/Payable, and every other real asset/liability \u2014 are never touched by this process at all. Their real, ending balance simply carries forward as-is, automatically becoming the new period's own opening balance, since a real balance-sheet account is a genuine, persistent running total, not something that resets each period the way income and expense do." Template=review Title="Year End Close"
    - :Field Choices=reportingPeriods Control=select Empty="Pick a period\u2026" Hint="Computed from this business's own financial-year start date and reporting frequency \u2014 pick one to fill in the as-of date (and, below, a suggested new ledger name) instead of working it out by hand." Label="Reporting Period" Name=period Reacts=periodChosen
    - :Field Control=date Default=today Label="As of date" Name=asOfDate
    - :Field Choices=equityAccounts Control=select Label="Retained earnings account" Name=retainedEarnings
    - :Section Accept=closeBooks "Accept Label"="Accept and close" Hint="Nothing posts yet \u2014 the next step shows the real, proposed general journal entry for you to review, before anything is actually closed." Name=close "Proposal Title"="Proposed general journal entry" Propose=closeBooks "Propose Label"="Preview the close" Title="Close the books"
    - :Section Accept=rollover "Accept Label"="Accept and roll over" Intro="Carries every real, non-zero Balance Sheet account \u2014 Cash, Inventory, Accounts Receivable/Payable, and every other real asset/liability/equity \u2014 forward into a new ledger as that ledger's own opening balance, as of the date above. Run this after closing the books above, since a real rollover should only ever carry forward real Balance Sheet accounts once Income/Expense have already been closed into Retained Earnings." Name=rollover "Proposal Title"="Proposed opening-balance entry" Propose=rollover "Propose Label"="Resolve opening balances" Title="Roll over to a new period"
